{"miesto":"proof:p-dim3","otazka":"Inak: vypočítaj mi inverziu 17 modulo 60 rozšíreným Euklidovým algoritmom a ukáž kroky.","fotky":0,"zastavene":false,"text":"Euklidovým algoritmom dostaneš:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n60 &= 3\\cdot17+9,\\\\\n17 &= 1\\cdot9+8,\\\\\n9 &= 1\\cdot8+1,\\\\\n8 &= 8\\cdot1+0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nPosledný nenulový zvyšok je $1$. Spätným dosadzovaním ho vyjadríš pomocou $60$ a $17$:\n$$\n1=9-8=9-(17-9)=2\\cdot9-17\n=2(60-3\\cdot17)-17=2\\cdot60-7\\cdot17.\n$$\nModulo $60$ člen $2\\cdot60$ vypadne, takže $(-7)\\cdot17\\equiv1\\pmod{60}$. Inverzia je teda koeficient pri $17$: keďže $-7\\equiv53\\pmod{60}$, dostaneš **$17^{-1}\\equiv53\\pmod{60}$**.\n\n<krokovac ref=\"k1\"\/>","nastroje":["cisla","cisla"],"udalosti":[{"t":8,"e":"reset"},{"t":8,"e":"stav","d":"Premýšľam"},{"t":3108,"e":"stav","d":"Overujem výpočet"},{"t":3111,"e":"reset"},{"t":3111,"e":"stav","d":"Píšem odpoveď"},{"t":6875,"e":"stav","d":"Overujem výpočet"},{"t":6876,"e":"reset"},{"t":6876,"e":"stav","d":"Píšem odpoveď"},{"t":8999,"e":"stav","d":""},{"t":8999,"e":"text","d":"E"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":"uk"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":"lid"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":"ovým"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":" algorit"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":"mom"},{"t":9175,"e":"text","d":" dost"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"ane"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"š"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":":\n"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"$$"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"\n"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"\\"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"begin"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"{"},{"t":9354,"e":"text","d":"aligned"},{"t":9355,"e":"text","d":"}\n"},{"t":9355,"e":"text","d":"60"},{"t":9527,"e":"text","d":" &="},{"t":9637,"e":"text","d":" "},{"t":9637,"e":"text","d":"3"},{"t":9637,"e":"text","d":"\\"},{"t":9637,"e":"text","d":"cd"},{"t":9640,"e":"text","d":"ot"},{"t":9640,"e":"text","d":"17"},{"t":9640,"e":"text","d":"+"},{"t":9640,"e":"text","d":"9"},{"t":9863,"e":"text","d":","},{"t":9863,"e":"text","d":"\\\\"},{"t":9863,"e":"text","d":"\n"},